Research Work

This project is a modified fork of LLM Wiki.

Original project:
https://github.com/nashsu/llm_wiki

Original license:
GPL-3.0

The original LLM Wiki project provides the desktop application foundation,
including source ingestion, Markdown Wiki generation, search, knowledge graph,
review workflows, local persistence, and related tooling.

This fork adds research workflow features including submission management,
idea capture, quick capture, and bidirectional knowledge linking.

The modified source code is distributed under GPL-3.0 in accordance with the
original project license.

